# Build output
bin/

# Generated assembly attributes, written by build.ps1 from the git tag. Deliberately not committed:
# a checked-in copy is the version drift this replaced.
obj/

# vendor\Mono.Cecil.dll is deliberately NOT ignored: the launcher stages its own Cecil so a build
# works with no game installed, and pinning the version means a release cannot ship against a
# different one than it was tested with. See vendor\README.md.

# BepInEx install output, if someone runs the tool from a clone next to the game
BepInEx/

